    {
      "id": "counter_semantics",
      "finding": "Actual FE uses 32-bit next_id/completed_id counters reset to zero, not idma_tf_id_gen. next increments per accepted top-level descriptor, completed per ordered top-level completion; completed is one past last retired ID. busy is next!=completed. selector0=completed; selector1=next; selector2=busy; selector3=!twod_ready. Native dma_wait polls signed completed-tid>0; require fresh IDs and modular signed distance below 2^31. No wrap/fault execution was performed. Separate idma_tf_id_gen starts2/completed1 and is not instantiated in the active FE; its semantics must not be substituted.",
